+
+## 6. Deployment plan (do not execute yet — awaiting approval)
+
+1. Review the diff on branch `fix/video-pipeline-audit`. Six source files + 1 SQL migration + tests + evidence.
+2. Run `scripts/repair-video-urls.sql` against the production Postgres (DigitalOcean Managed Database). Idempotent — safe to dry-run inside a `BEGIN; … ROLLBACK;` first.
